!libs/breengel-abi/**
!libs/gpu-abi/
!libs/gpu-abi/**
!libs/libbreenix/
!libs/libbreenix/**
!libs/breenix_std/
!libs/breenix_std/**
!libs/libbreenix-libc/
!libs/libbreenix-libc/**
